cff-version: 1.2.0
# The release is archived at Zenodo. The DOI below is the version DOI, which
# cites the release tagged v0.1.0; the concept DOI under identifiers resolves
# to the latest release. The version carried here is the one micecoff reports.
message: "If you use this software, cite it as below. Cite the released data tables with docs/DATA_CITATION.cff."
title: "bdq-cfz-mic-atlas: a quantitative atlas of Rv0678 and MmpL5 mutation effects on bedaquiline and clofazimine MICs"
abstract: >-
  An open, versioned resource quantifying how mutations in the Rv0678 and MmpL5
  efflux axis shift bedaquiline and clofazimine minimum inhibitory
  concentrations in Mycobacterium tuberculosis, together with a reproducible
  pipeline that regenerates the resource against each new release of the
  CRyPTIC Consortium Dataset. The interval-censored estimator the pipeline uses
  is packaged as micecoff, whose command line interface fits MIC distributions,
  the shift between groups and epidemiological cut-offs from a CSV of readings.
type: software
